      "label": "migrants crossing a border fence",
      "description": "A group of people, including a woman holding a child, are climbing or being assisted over a border fence. The scene is set outdoors on a dirt path with a fence and hills in the background. The participants are engaged in a collective effort to cross the border, with some individuals helping others. The text overlay suggests a political commentary about granting rights to those who have no right to be there.",
