      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "democrats",
      "label": "Political Party",
      "description": "The Democratic Party of the United States, a major political party that has historically advocated for immigration reform, including pathways to citizenship for undocumented immigrants. The meme uses this term to frame a political stance, implying that the party is granting rights to those without legal status, which is a contentious political claim.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
