      "instance_name": "fetus_scene",
      "label": "Abortion Rights Context",
      "description": "The image of a fetus is used to invoke debates around abortion rights and reproductive autonomy. The meme equates the legal status of undocumented immigrants with the moral or legal status of a fetus, which is a contentious and often harmful political argument that conflates two distinct social issues.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_4355d671"
