      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "fetus_rights",
      "label": "Abortion Rights Debate",
      "description": "The use of the fetus image to represent 'those who do have rights' is a loaded reference to the abortion rights debate. It implies that the fetus has rights that are being 'taken' by granting rights to immigrants, which is a misleading and inflammatory comparison that conflates two distinct social issues.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
